<<<
+ every one, INTO & in to, ONTO & on to, see the words in small capitals. For blackbird & black bird, see HYPHENS; for no-one & no one, & for in no wise & in nowise, NO, 53; for someone & some one, EVERYONE.
===
+ *every one*, ^^INTO^^ & *in to*, ^^ONTO^^ & *on to*, see the words in small capitals. For *blackbird* & *black bird*, see ^^HYPHENS^^; for *no-one* & *no one*, & for *in no wise* & *in nowise*, ^^NO^^, 5; for *someone* & *some one*, ^^EVERYONE^^.
>>>

